        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer grid, class 5</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer grid, class 5
Sewer system for municipal wastewater treatment plant capacity class 5 with an average per-captia equivalent PCE (Einwohnergleichwert) of 806. Average length 6.13 km. The lifetime is 100 years including a renovation after 70 years.;
Synonyms: municipal sewer infrastructure for capacity class 5; 
UUID: 8711a922-efb1-3f44-9894-dfb20f10f5b1
Infrastructure materials for municipal sewer system, transports, dismantling.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Underground sewer system with pipes
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8711a922-efb1-3f44-9894-dfb20f10f5b1.xml</text>
